1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,611
Olá. This is Liam, in for Bear. Anthropic's claude tag plugins repo doesn't hook

2
00:00:04,631 --> 00:00:09,572
Claude up to everything. Each service is its own plugin, so the real question is

3
00:00:09,592 --> 00:00:10,895
what your team uses.

4
00:00:10,965 --> 00:00:15,716
A plugin: one service's skill and scripts, packed to install. An agent scope:

5
00:00:15,736 --> 00:00:20,486
Claude's settings for one workspace, or one channel. And an identity profile: a

6
00:00:20,506 --> 00:00:23,055
reusable bundle of rules, credentials and plugins.

7
00:00:23,125 --> 00:00:27,451
Here's your team's workspace, drawn as a wall of sockets, one for each service it

8
00:00:27,471 --> 00:00:32,376
could use. And here's Claude Tag: the Claude that answers when you tag it in a chat

9
00:00:32,396 --> 00:00:34,404
thread, backed by remote Claude Code sessions.

10
00:00:34,474 --> 00:00:39,085
The repo lists eighteen plugins. Sixteen are services, from Asana and Big Query to

11
00:00:39,105 --> 00:00:44,377
Jira and Datadog. The other two are helpers. You add the repo as a marketplace, then

12
00:00:44,397 --> 00:00:46,031
install the services you use.

13
00:00:46,101 --> 00:00:50,954
Each service is its own plugin, so a workspace can connect exactly the services it

14
00:00:50,974 --> 00:00:56,477
uses. Say this team works in Asana, and keeps its data in Big Query. Two plugs go

15
00:00:56,497 --> 00:00:58,426
in. Every other socket stays empty.

16
00:00:58,496 --> 00:01:04,333
Now tag Claude in a thread. It can reach those two: Asana tasks, and S Q L in Big

17
00:01:04,353 --> 00:01:08,649
Query. Each skill activates when it's relevant. Ask about Jira, and there's no Jira

18
00:01:08,669 --> 00:01:09,882
plugin to reach for.

19
00:01:09,952 --> 00:01:15,134
Open one plug. There's a manifest, plugin dot json. A skill: how to connect, and the

20
00:01:15,154 --> 00:01:19,360
core operations. A catalog of endpoints, read only when needed. And usually, small

21
00:01:19,380 --> 00:01:24,237
scripts. What you won't find is a key. The runtime injects the credentials into each

22
00:01:24,257 --> 00:01:24,562
request.

23
00:01:24,632 --> 00:01:28,271
Claude's settings come in layers: the organization, a workspace, then a channel.

24
00:01:28,291 --> 00:01:33,456
Plugins add up along that chain. A channel can plug in more, but can't unplug what a

25
00:01:33,476 --> 00:01:37,725
layer above provides. So what you plug in at the top reaches every channel.

26
00:01:37,795 --> 00:01:41,477
For GitHub, the repo's best practice goes further: a read-only profile bound

27
00:01:41,497 --> 00:01:46,104
everywhere, and a write profile bound only to the channels allowed to push or merge.

28
00:01:46,124 --> 00:01:51,348
That limits the blast radius. Plug in what you use, and give each plug the least it

29
00:01:51,368 --> 00:01:51,656
needs.

30
00:01:51,726 --> 00:01:56,141
Now the two helpers. Hand the data visualization plugin a table, say rows from Big

31
00:01:56,161 --> 00:02:02,350
Query, and it composes a polished chart: a P N G, an S V G, or an interactive H T M

32
00:02:02,370 --> 00:02:02,941
L page.

33
00:02:03,011 --> 00:02:07,775
The other helper is troubleshoot. Config changes only reach new sessions, so start a

34
00:02:07,795 --> 00:02:12,560
fresh Slack thread. Then run debug plugins. From inside the session, it checks which

35
00:02:12,580 --> 00:02:14,952
plugins actually loaded, which failed, and why.

36
00:02:15,022 --> 00:02:19,059
Your turn. Paste this into Claude: Here are the tools my team uses each week: list

37
00:02:19,079 --> 00:02:22,863
them. From the plugin list in Anthropic's claude tag plugins repo, pick the ones our

38
00:02:22,883 --> 00:02:26,920
Claude Tag needs. For each, say whether it should only read or also write, and in

39
00:02:26,940 --> 00:02:30,470
which channels. Then list what to leave unplugged, and why. Then check two things

40
00:02:30,490 --> 00:02:34,274
yourself. For every plugin, who used that tool this week? And for every write, which

41
00:02:34,294 --> 00:02:35,542
channel and task need it?

42
00:02:35,612 --> 00:02:39,806
One Plugin per Service. At Nik Bear Brown.
